            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Yak 1.17.34</h2>
<p>Say a math problem like 'what is 24 divided by 2' and Yak pastes the answer. Saying 'em dash' now types a real dash. More misheard spellings of 'exclamation point' now become a real exclamation mark. Copy Last Dictation and History and Words are now at the top of the menu.</p>
]]></description>
